<title>PERU: Peru says Doe Run has La Oroya option.</title>
<headline>Peru says Doe Run has La Oroya option.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's state miner Centromin said Thursday U.S. firm Doe Run Co had the option to acquire a 60 percent stake in the La Oroya metallurgic complex after Mexico's Penoles withdrew its purchase offer.</p>
<p>Doe Run was runner up in an April 18 auction for rights to La Oroya.</p>
